   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the insurance law, in relation to annuity dividend reinvestment",
    "basePrintNo": "S2525",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2525-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §4231, Ins L",
    "lawSection": "Insurance Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S2525\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\n\nAn act to amend the insurance law, in relation to annuity dividend\nreinvestment\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSection 1 of the bill would amend section 4231 of the Insurance Law to\nclarify that for purposes of any individual or group participating\nannuity contract, the annuitant may elect to reinvest the annuity\ndividend.\n\nSection 2 is the effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThis proposal seeks to amend § 4231 of the insurance law to clarify\nthat paid-up additions are an option for the use of policyholder\ndividends by annuitants. This revision is beneficial to the annuity\ncustomer since it will allow them to have the option to automatically\nreinvest their policyholder dividend distributions to paid-up\nadditions in their annuity contract, which can then be converted into\nfuture income.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "printNo": "S2525",
    "publishDate": "2017-01-13",
    "relatedLaws": {
     "items": {},
     "size": 0
    },
